WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:00.000 --> 00:01.000
MkvDrama.net

3
01:30.340 --> 01:33.578
=Against The Current=

4
01:33.579 --> 01:35.000
(Adapted from He Yanshan's novel, Orchid Fragrance Fate)

5
01:35.180 --> 01:36.920
=Episode 37= (This drama does not correspond)

6
01:36.930 --> 01:38.200
(to any real historical dynasty.)

7
01:38.210 --> 01:41.160
(The systems, culture, attire and other dynastic elements have been adapted.)

8
01:41.350 --> 01:42.120
Captain Wei.

9
01:45.400 --> 01:46.200
Lin Jinqi.

10
01:47.680 --> 01:49.310
What we did was rebellion.

11
01:50.040 --> 01:52.070
Are you saying you can offer us a way out?

12
01:54.200 --> 01:55.120
Wei.

13
01:56.480 --> 01:58.200
You can still atone by earning merit.

14
03:27.750 --> 03:31.030
Presenting Duke Ying.

15
03:35.620 --> 03:37.550
(Duke Ying, Grand Preceptor, Commander of the Five Armies Camp)

16
03:37.560 --> 03:39.540
(Left Chief Commander of the Central Military Command)

17
03:39.560 --> 03:41.992
I deserve death for arriving too late to protect Your Majesty.

18
03:42.008 --> 03:44.240
Forgive me for letting Your Majesty suffer such a fright.

19
03:47.360 --> 03:49.560
I know you've fought all night without rest.

20
03:49.630 --> 03:50.750
You've worked hard.

21
03:51.590 --> 03:54.080
With you by my side, the realm is truly blessed.

22
03:55.520 --> 03:56.840
I'm unworthy of such praise.

23
03:57.096 --> 03:58.190
We quelled this rebellion

24
03:58.310 --> 04:00.240
thanks to Your Majesty's great fortune

25
04:00.910 --> 04:03.430
and every official who did their duty.

26
04:03.520 --> 04:05.030
As for the rebels in the city,

27
04:05.030 --> 04:07.112
those who resisted to the end have all been executed.

28
04:07.280 --> 04:08.910
The rest are in custody,

29
04:09.280 --> 04:11.280
awaiting Your Majesty's judgment.

30
04:12.120 --> 04:13.710
Have you counted them?

31
04:13.750 --> 04:15.310
How many rebels escaped?

32
04:16.040 --> 04:17.270
Yes, we have.

33
04:17.310 --> 04:19.600
Over 2,000 rebels fled the capital.

34
04:21.680 --> 04:22.310
Your Majesty.

35
04:22.472 --> 04:24.120
With the rebels scattered everywhere,

36
04:24.120 --> 04:25.800
they're sure to plunder the people.

37
04:25.870 --> 04:28.530
If they turn into roving bandits, they'll plague the whole region.

38
04:28.712 --> 04:30.560
I ask Your Majesty to issue an order at once

39
04:30.560 --> 04:33.120
and send troops to wipe out Prince Han's remaining forces.

40
04:33.750 --> 04:35.160
Grand Secretary Xie is right.

41
04:35.848 --> 04:37.720
Hunting down Prince Han's remaining forces

42
04:37.912 --> 04:39.400
will be the duke's responsibility.

43
04:40.600 --> 04:42.120
I'll do everything in my power

44
04:42.190 --> 04:43.600
to restore peace to the people.

45
04:45.390 --> 04:46.480
In quelling this rebellion,

46
04:46.870 --> 04:48.720
Fengtai not only warned us in advance,

47
04:49.070 --> 04:50.950
but also sent word to Duke Ying in time.

48
04:51.240 --> 04:52.360
His merit is immense.

49
04:53.120 --> 04:54.870
Now no one knows if he's alive or dead.

50
04:55.360 --> 04:57.480
While you hunt down Prince Han's remaining forces,

51
04:57.750 --> 04:59.360
be sure to look for Fengtai.

52
05:00.070 --> 05:01.270
As Your Majesty commands.

53
05:01.950 --> 05:02.720
Your Majesty,

54
05:03.480 --> 05:05.270
according to my men who led the search,

55
05:05.430 --> 05:07.560
Madam Lin is missing, too.

56
05:08.160 --> 05:10.390
She's most likely with Deputy Commander Lin.

57
05:12.680 --> 05:13.920
In this bitter cold,

58
05:14.070 --> 05:15.750
Madam Lin is a frail woman,

59
05:16.120 --> 05:17.360
and Fengtai is wounded.

60
05:17.672 --> 05:19.240
Their lives must be in grave danger.

61
05:19.510 --> 05:21.270
Find them both as soon as possible.

62
05:22.360 --> 05:23.120
Yes, Your Majesty.

63
05:25.070 --> 05:25.630
Your Majesty,

64
05:26.104 --> 05:27.310
I'd like to leave the city

65
05:27.750 --> 05:28.720
and help Duke Ying

66
05:29.310 --> 05:30.560
search for Deputy Commander Lin

67
05:32.040 --> 05:32.870
and Madam Lin.

68
05:34.720 --> 05:35.310
Granted.

69
05:39.160 --> 05:43.870
- Deputy Commander Lin! - Deputy Commander Lin!

70
05:43.950 --> 05:44.870
Young Master!

71
05:45.160 --> 05:46.270
Deputy Commander Lin!

72
05:46.310 --> 05:47.630
Young Master!

73
05:48.870 --> 05:50.110
Over there! Go take a look!

74
05:50.120 --> 05:51.990
- Deputy Commander Lin! - Deputy Commander Lin!

75
05:52.008 --> 05:52.720
Young Master!

76
05:52.720 --> 05:54.950
- Deputy Commander Lin! - Deputy Commander Lin!

77
05:55.800 --> 05:57.270
Young Master!

78
05:58.510 --> 06:00.310
Young Master!

79
06:00.870 --> 06:01.190
Lan...

80
06:01.352 --> 06:03.310
- Deputy Commander Lin! - Deputy Commander Lin!

81
06:12.510 --> 06:13.360
Deputy Commander Lin!

82
06:21.160 --> 06:21.830
Compiler Han.

83
06:39.070 --> 06:40.310
This turmoil...

84
06:42.360 --> 06:44.750
Countless innocent people in and around the capital

85
06:46.120 --> 06:47.240
were caught up in it

86
06:49.120 --> 06:50.160
and lost their lives.

87
06:52.800 --> 06:53.750
Deputy Commander Lin...

88
06:57.680 --> 06:58.950
Give them a proper burial.

89
06:59.510 --> 07:00.190
Yes, sir.

90
07:03.160 --> 07:04.000
Compiler Han.

91
07:05.830 --> 07:06.510
Compiler Han.

92
07:06.520 --> 07:07.920
The soldiers up ahead report there's

93
07:07.950 --> 07:09.816
- fighting at the Shenji Battalion. - Deputy Commander Lin!

94
07:10.000 --> 07:10.830
The Shenji Battalion?

95
07:13.120 --> 07:14.720
It should be empty by now.

96
07:17.288 --> 07:20.040
Could Deputy Commander Lin and the others have gone back?

97
07:27.940 --> 07:31.620
(Dong Qingzhu, daughter of the Assistant Magistrate of Wanping County)

98
07:32.040 --> 07:32.950
We surrender.

99
07:33.430 --> 07:34.830
We said we surrender!

100
07:35.920 --> 07:37.160
We told you to surrender before,

101
07:37.160 --> 07:38.160
and you refused.

102
07:39.510 --> 07:40.680
Whether you can surrender now

103
07:40.680 --> 07:42.310
isn't up to you.

104
07:43.120 --> 07:44.510
It's up to us.

105
07:45.310 --> 07:47.120
Don't force us to fight you to the death!

106
07:54.040 --> 07:56.310
- Then we'll fight to the death. - Stay back.

107
07:57.000 --> 07:58.160
My father has been avenged.

108
07:59.120 --> 08:00.190
I'm not afraid to die.

109
08:00.750 --> 08:01.510
Stay back.

110
08:08.190 --> 08:09.000
Then tell us,

111
08:09.480 --> 08:10.750
what does it take to surrender?

112
08:13.800 --> 08:16.480
Those who haven't harmed civilians may surrender.

113
08:17.070 --> 08:19.270
Those who haven't violated women may surrender.

114
08:19.352 --> 08:20.390
What about those who stole

115
08:20.408 --> 08:21.720
but didn't kill anyone? Can they surrender?

116
08:21.750 --> 08:22.240
Yes.

117
08:23.160 --> 08:23.950
They may.

118
08:24.264 --> 08:26.540
But the stolen goods must be returned to the county office,

119
08:26.550 --> 08:28.024
and they must accept their punishment.

120
08:28.344 --> 08:30.870
A hundred strokes of the cane and three years of penal servitude.

121
08:30.936 --> 08:32.648
- I'm not surrendering! - I surrender!

122
08:34.320 --> 08:35.120
What did you say?

123
08:35.120 --> 08:35.870
I surrender!

124
08:36.080 --> 08:37.270
Say that again!

125
08:37.750 --> 08:38.510
I surrender!

126
08:42.024 --> 08:44.120
Clever. She turned them against each other.

127
08:44.152 --> 08:46.170
That's the only daughter of the Assistant Magistrate of Wanping County,

128
08:46.184 --> 08:46.920
Young Lady Dong.

129
08:47.400 --> 08:48.750
After Prince Han rose in rebellion,

130
08:48.760 --> 08:50.488
Assistant Magistrate Dong refused to yield

131
08:50.910 --> 08:52.080
and was murdered by Dai Rui.

132
08:52.870 --> 08:54.480
Amid the chaos, Young Lady Dong

133
08:54.480 --> 08:56.360
rallied the constables and townsfolk

134
08:56.568 --> 08:58.104
and killed Dai Rui with her own hands.

135
08:58.790 --> 08:59.840
After Prince Han's defeat,

136
09:00.080 --> 09:01.630
his remaining troops fled in a panic.

137
09:02.320 --> 09:04.150
Young Lady Dong feared they would

138
09:04.150 --> 09:05.480
prey on the people along the way,

139
09:05.480 --> 09:06.940
so she pursued them all the way here.

140
09:10.030 --> 09:10.720
Let's go.

141
09:14.270 --> 09:16.550
- Get down! All of you, get down! - Get down!

142
09:19.480 --> 09:20.270
Young Lady Dong.

143
09:20.280 --> 09:21.950
Duke Ying has been ordered by His Majesty

144
09:21.960 --> 09:23.640
to wipe out Prince Han's remaining forces.

145
09:23.670 --> 09:26.150
Leave this to the Five Armies Camp.

146
09:27.240 --> 09:27.910
All right.

147
09:32.270 --> 09:33.080
Behave yourselves!

148
09:52.720 --> 09:55.180
♪Every word♪

149
09:55.448 --> 09:56.990
- Young Lady Dong! - Young Lady Dong!

150
09:57.000 --> 09:58.616
- Young Lady Dong! - Young Lady Dong!

151
10:00.280 --> 10:02.970
♪The encounters of half a lifetime♪

152
10:03.000 --> 10:04.470
- Young Lady Dong! - Young Lady Dong!

153
10:04.480 --> 10:05.180
Young Lady Dong!

154
10:05.288 --> 10:05.960
Young Lady Dong!

155
10:06.000 --> 10:07.608
- Young Lady Dong! - Young Lady Dong!

156
10:07.710 --> 10:14.380
♪Bit by bit, the passing years become the preface♪

157
10:15.180 --> 10:17.840
♪The joys and sorrows of the past♪

158
10:17.840 --> 10:22.750
♪Quietly dwell here♪

159
10:23.670 --> 10:24.720
Are you an official?

160
10:26.344 --> 10:27.960
I'm a Compiler at the Hanlin Academy.

161
10:28.550 --> 10:30.320
My name is Han Liang.

162
10:31.120 --> 10:31.960
Compiler Han,

163
10:32.200 --> 10:33.960
please find a physician for Young Lady Dong.

164
10:34.840 --> 10:35.750
I'm fine.

165
10:36.750 --> 10:38.750
I just haven't eaten in a day and a night,

166
10:39.510 --> 10:41.200
so I'm a little dizzy and weak.

167
10:43.000 --> 10:43.910
Compiler Han,

168
10:45.080 --> 10:46.870
the people who came with me

169
10:47.630 --> 10:49.360
are at the end of their strength, too.

170
10:50.440 --> 10:52.270
They badly need food and rest.

171
10:54.440 --> 10:55.720
May I trouble you, Compiler Han,

172
10:56.110 --> 10:58.840
to send men to escort them back to the assistant magistrate's office

173
10:59.910 --> 11:01.720
and arrange meals and lodging for them?

174
11:02.296 --> 11:04.392
Those who keep watch through the night for others

175
11:05.910 --> 11:07.960
deserve to see the light of dawn.

176
11:08.888 --> 11:10.790
At the office, there are still wounded people

177
11:10.790 --> 11:12.320
in need of treatment,

178
11:13.510 --> 11:15.510
and children who have lost their parents.

179
11:16.750 --> 11:17.960
Rest assured, Young Lady Dong.

180
11:18.960 --> 11:19.600
I will make sure

181
11:20.360 --> 11:22.120
every one of them is well cared for.

182
11:23.690 --> 11:27.740
♪With my own hands and heart♪

183
11:27.740 --> 11:31.270
♪I write my name♪

184
11:31.660 --> 11:34.980
♪Through countless lines of ink♪

185
11:35.310 --> 11:38.560
♪Step by step toward the light♪

186
11:38.560 --> 11:42.610
♪With what I know and what I do♪

187
11:42.830 --> 11:46.040
♪I'll rewrite my fate♪

188
11:46.040 --> 11:47.440
♪The long night is almost over♪

189
11:47.440 --> 11:48.240
Compiler Han.

190
11:50.488 --> 11:52.770
All of Prince Han's remaining forces have been captured.

191
11:53.150 --> 11:54.720
Would you like to come with us

192
11:54.720 --> 11:56.504
and keep searching for Deputy Commander Lin?

193
12:06.480 --> 12:07.200
Compiler Han?

194
12:09.750 --> 12:11.240
I just promised Young Lady Dong

195
12:11.960 --> 12:13.960
I'd help settle the people.

196
12:14.920 --> 12:16.270
As for finding Deputy Commander Lin

197
12:18.030 --> 12:18.910
and Madam Lin,

198
12:20.408 --> 12:21.720
I'll have to leave that to you.

199
12:22.910 --> 12:24.080
Don't worry, Compiler Han.

200
12:24.550 --> 12:25.360
Thank you.

201
12:33.720 --> 12:34.750
What gives you the nerve

202
12:34.750 --> 12:36.270
to call yourselves an elite force?

203
12:36.312 --> 12:38.840
You're not even a match for Compiler Han of the Hanlin Academy!

204
12:40.240 --> 12:42.390
He's just a frail scholar,

205
12:42.790 --> 12:45.150
and he captured dozens of rebels from the Tiance Guards!

206
12:46.510 --> 12:49.270
I sent you to find Deputy Commander Lin and Madam Lin,

207
12:49.440 --> 12:51.080
and you came back empty-handed.

208
12:51.910 --> 12:53.870
I sent you after Prince Han's remaining forces,

209
12:54.750 --> 12:56.550
and you still came back empty-handed!

210
12:57.360 --> 12:59.150
Over two thousand of Prince Han's men

211
12:59.320 --> 13:00.270
are scattered about,

212
13:00.320 --> 13:01.512
burning, killing, and looting.

213
13:01.672 --> 13:03.320
People should be coming to report them.

214
13:03.550 --> 13:04.670
Yet apart from yesterday,

215
13:04.790 --> 13:06.270
when some people were harmed,

216
13:06.750 --> 13:07.320
since then,

217
13:07.840 --> 13:09.320
not a single straggler has been seen.

218
13:09.910 --> 13:11.000
It's very strange.

219
13:11.440 --> 13:12.200
It's as if

220
13:12.392 --> 13:14.240
someone got ahead of us to steal the credit.

221
13:14.750 --> 13:15.720
Steal the credit?

222
13:16.888 --> 13:19.030
Who else in the capital besides our Five Armies Camp

223
13:19.030 --> 13:19.960
could possibly do that?

224
13:21.510 --> 13:23.870
You're all useless!

225
13:24.440 --> 13:27.390
How am I supposed to face His Majesty?

226
13:37.630 --> 13:38.480
Your Grace.

227
13:38.840 --> 13:39.630
What is it?

228
13:39.672 --> 13:41.064
Sun Yong and Wei Bao are here with Prince Han's

229
13:41.070 --> 13:42.490
remaining forces, asking to see you.

230
13:42.870 --> 13:45.030
What nonsense are you talking?

231
13:45.928 --> 13:48.030
It's bad enough you can't find Deputy Commander Lin,

232
13:48.630 --> 13:50.320
but now you're accusing his men

233
13:50.320 --> 13:51.870
of colluding with Prince Han's rebels?

234
13:51.870 --> 13:52.650
No, that's not it.

235
13:52.790 --> 13:55.550
Sun Yong and Wei Bao have come together to surrender.

236
13:56.240 --> 13:56.840
No...

237
13:56.856 --> 13:58.630
Come see for yourself and you'll understand.

238
13:58.750 --> 13:59.790
I can walk on my own!

239
14:06.270 --> 14:07.550
Easy, brothers.

240
14:08.960 --> 14:11.510
These men have all turned from the wrong path

241
14:11.544 --> 14:13.080
and pledged allegiance to His Majesty!

242
14:21.100 --> 14:22.700
I, Wei Bao, leading the Changling Guards

243
14:22.750 --> 14:24.220
and what remains of the Tiance Guards,

244
14:24.248 --> 14:25.440
pay respects to Duke Ying.

245
14:29.700 --> 14:32.110
Deputy Commander Lin and I became friends after crossing swords.

246
14:32.120 --> 14:33.150
At his urging...

247
14:38.056 --> 14:39.460
I chose to stand on the right side.

248
14:39.750 --> 14:40.840
After Prince Han's defeat,

249
14:40.936 --> 14:42.136
Captain Wei stepped forward

250
14:42.140 --> 14:44.480
to persuade Prince Han's remaining troops to surrender,

251
14:44.870 --> 14:46.510
sparing the people further harm.

252
14:47.080 --> 14:48.510
That's a great merit indeed.

253
14:51.000 --> 14:53.000
I owe it all to Captain Sun's help along the way.

254
14:54.904 --> 14:57.200
His Majesty has been worried about Deputy Commander Lin.

255
14:57.870 --> 14:59.440
Where is he now?

256
14:59.840 --> 15:00.550
Duke Ying,

257
15:03.080 --> 15:04.720
Deputy Commander Lin was badly wounded.

258
15:05.360 --> 15:06.600
Nanke and Jiugao

259
15:06.610 --> 15:08.890
have already escorted him and Madam Lin back to the city.

260
15:18.860 --> 15:21.540
(Lasting Grace)

261
15:35.030 --> 15:37.960
The wound on Deputy Commander Lin's left hand looks alarming,

262
15:38.480 --> 15:39.480
but it's nothing serious.

263
15:40.120 --> 15:41.750
It'll just ache a little

264
15:42.080 --> 15:43.200
on rainy days.

265
15:45.150 --> 15:47.360
His internal injuries are the real concern.

266
15:47.790 --> 15:49.200
They've affected his vital organs.

267
15:49.840 --> 15:51.750
He must rest and recover properly.

268
15:52.320 --> 15:53.270
Otherwise,

269
15:53.910 --> 15:55.960
it may shorten his life.

270
16:00.408 --> 16:01.750
Thank you, Imperial Physician Yao.

271
16:01.848 --> 16:03.550
We'll follow your instructions carefully.

272
16:03.840 --> 16:06.150
He'll take his medicine on time and rest well.

273
16:06.510 --> 16:09.630
His Majesty is deeply concerned about Deputy Commander Lin's injuries

274
16:10.320 --> 16:12.630
and is waiting for my report in the palace.

275
16:13.440 --> 16:14.270
So I

276
16:15.840 --> 16:16.750
will take my leave.

277
16:16.792 --> 16:18.216
Take care, Imperial Physician Yao.

278
16:29.030 --> 16:30.030
Jinqi, Lanxiang,

279
16:30.600 --> 16:32.390
what took you so long?

280
16:32.840 --> 16:34.440
We were worried sick.

281
16:35.550 --> 16:37.840
Well, we're back safe and sound, aren't we?

282
16:51.480 --> 16:53.150
Thank you for all your hard work, Jinlan.

283
16:54.320 --> 16:57.440
Not a single life was lost in the entire household.

284
16:58.480 --> 16:59.910
That's all thanks to you.

285
17:02.110 --> 17:03.500
Lanxiang is the one we should thank.

286
17:05.510 --> 17:07.240
Luckily, she had the foresight

287
17:07.480 --> 17:09.070
and sent Yuchan back to warn us.

288
17:09.944 --> 17:11.510
That's how we could prepare in advance

289
17:11.528 --> 17:12.712
and stay out of harm's way.

290
17:13.960 --> 17:15.400
I just happened to stumble upon it.

291
17:16.240 --> 17:17.480
How are you feeling, Jinlan?

292
17:21.310 --> 17:22.160
I'm fine.

293
17:22.920 --> 17:23.790
Just a bit tired.

294
17:23.900 --> 17:25.240
A few days' rest and I'll be well.

295
17:25.848 --> 17:27.110
Don't worry about me, Lanxiang.

296
17:29.640 --> 17:30.750
Jinqi needs his rest.

297
17:31.440 --> 17:32.440
We'll be going now.

298
17:33.350 --> 17:34.030
All right.

299
17:36.160 --> 17:36.960
I'll go, too.

300
17:37.750 --> 17:39.400
I'll come see you both tomorrow.

301
17:46.270 --> 17:46.920
Let's go.

302
17:52.310 --> 17:53.000
Xiulai,

303
17:53.550 --> 17:54.640
keep your brother company.

304
17:54.880 --> 17:55.880
I'll be right back.

305
18:04.480 --> 18:06.160
Are you worried about Jun?

306
18:11.920 --> 18:12.590
Jinqi,

307
18:12.936 --> 18:14.216
Jun is only nine.

308
18:14.312 --> 18:16.710
The whole Lu family has been thrown into the imperial prison.

309
18:16.720 --> 18:19.550
I know rebellion is a crime punishable by wiping out the entire clan.

310
18:20.720 --> 18:22.480
That wretch brought it on himself.

311
18:25.160 --> 18:26.750
But Jun is my son.

312
18:27.270 --> 18:28.200
I just can't bear

313
18:28.200 --> 18:29.920
to stand by and watch him be beheaded.

314
18:32.360 --> 18:33.720
You're the only one I can turn to.

315
18:35.144 --> 18:36.400
Please, Jinqi, I'm begging you.

316
18:47.030 --> 18:47.920
I called you here

317
18:47.960 --> 18:49.030
only to find out

318
18:49.070 --> 18:50.790
how Xiaolian came to fall ill with a fever.

319
18:51.350 --> 18:52.240
Get up and answer me.

320
18:55.160 --> 18:55.550
Yes.

321
18:58.920 --> 19:00.350
The situation was urgent at the time.

322
19:00.920 --> 19:02.750
I had a servant who knew the mountain paths

323
19:02.790 --> 19:04.750
took me to a village near the Shenji Battalion,

324
19:04.960 --> 19:07.550
and ordered the driver to take Xiaolian back to the retreat.

325
19:08.000 --> 19:09.070
But Gantang said

326
19:09.544 --> 19:11.640
that when Xiaolian was brought back to the retreat,

327
19:11.650 --> 19:13.450
she already had a fever and was unconscious,

328
19:13.496 --> 19:15.400
and that you were the one who had her sent back.

329
19:15.960 --> 19:16.720
Xiaolian...

330
19:16.790 --> 19:19.550
That driver is still nowhere to be found.

331
19:20.960 --> 19:22.750
That's why I had Yang Fu bring you here,

332
19:23.030 --> 19:25.400
to find out exactly what happened.

333
19:25.920 --> 19:26.790
Young Madam,

334
19:27.256 --> 19:28.510
on the Young Master's orders,

335
19:28.520 --> 19:30.680
I was heading to the Five Armies Camp to see Duke Ying

336
19:31.000 --> 19:33.310
when I heard a woman crying for help.

337
19:33.720 --> 19:34.960
Bodhisattva, protect me.

338
19:35.480 --> 19:37.000
I don't want to die.

339
19:42.880 --> 19:44.160
Bodhisattva, protect me.

340
19:44.550 --> 19:47.790
Please send a kind soul to save me.

341
20:09.790 --> 20:11.000
Help...

342
20:14.640 --> 20:15.960
Help...

343
20:17.590 --> 20:20.160
Help!

344
20:38.160 --> 20:39.350
Nanke...

345
20:45.480 --> 20:48.070
When the driver heard there'd be fighting,

346
20:48.400 --> 20:51.030
he panicked and ran off, leaving me behind.

347
20:52.440 --> 20:57.030
He took all my money and jewelry.

348
21:27.880 --> 21:29.440
Young Lady Xiaolian was already so cold

349
21:29.440 --> 21:30.680
that she was shivering all over.

350
21:30.888 --> 21:32.890
But I thought the Young Master's orders came first,

351
21:33.200 --> 21:36.070
so I took her with me and rode hard all the way to the Five Armies Camp.

352
21:36.310 --> 21:37.510
That made her illness worse.

353
21:38.240 --> 21:40.880
Once I saw Duke Ying set out with his troops,

354
21:41.400 --> 21:43.440
I borrowed a carriage from the Five Armies Camp

355
21:43.920 --> 21:46.350
and asked them to take Young Lady Xiaolian to the retreat.

356
21:51.256 --> 21:53.240
Young Lady Xiaolian's illness is partly my fault.

357
21:53.592 --> 21:55.016
I'm willing to accept punishment.

358
21:55.790 --> 21:57.400
That driver is despicable.

359
21:58.270 --> 21:59.656
He mustn't be let off lightly.

360
22:01.830 --> 22:03.200
Please punish me, Young Madam.

361
22:03.880 --> 22:05.200
It was my poor judgment

362
22:05.550 --> 22:06.550
that led me to hire such

363
22:06.790 --> 22:08.480
a disloyal scoundrel.

364
22:08.616 --> 22:11.096
Are there any other servants like him in the household?

365
22:12.880 --> 22:13.310
Yes.

366
22:14.550 --> 22:16.550
Two servants took advantage of the chaos to steal

367
22:16.550 --> 22:18.780
the Second Young Lady's jewelry and money, then ran off.

368
22:19.310 --> 22:21.720
It's all because I've been too lax in managing them

369
22:21.736 --> 22:23.224
and failed to train them properly.

370
22:23.720 --> 22:24.640
Second Butler Yang,

371
22:24.888 --> 22:26.490
go report this to the authorities first.

372
22:27.000 --> 22:27.750
The rest

373
22:27.896 --> 22:29.550
can wait until everyone has recovered.

374
22:30.030 --> 22:30.680
Yes.

375
22:38.680 --> 22:39.960
Young Lady Xiaolian...

376
22:41.200 --> 22:42.400
Is she very ill?

377
22:44.344 --> 22:45.048
The physician said

378
22:45.080 --> 22:47.310
the worst thing for this illness is fright and worry.

379
22:47.350 --> 22:48.990
Luckily, the girl takes things in stride.

380
22:49.048 --> 22:50.030
A few more days of sleep,

381
22:50.440 --> 22:51.550
and she'll recover.

382
23:07.480 --> 23:08.880
You seem troubled, Young Madam.

383
23:09.480 --> 23:10.750
Is something bothering you?

384
23:15.656 --> 23:17.736
This time, thank goodness the Second Young Master

385
23:18.070 --> 23:19.240
was so careful.

386
23:20.000 --> 23:20.790
Otherwise,

387
23:21.110 --> 23:22.550
I'm afraid those servants

388
23:22.550 --> 23:24.490
would have sold out their masters to the rebels.

389
23:24.960 --> 23:26.000
And then,

390
23:26.680 --> 23:27.480
Yuchan,

391
23:27.960 --> 23:29.310
Xiulai, Xiuwan,

392
23:29.400 --> 23:30.160
and Yingzhi

393
23:31.112 --> 23:32.400
would all have been in danger.

394
23:35.880 --> 23:36.790
It's true.

395
23:37.960 --> 23:39.400
To bring order to one's household,

396
23:40.110 --> 23:41.510
one must first cultivate oneself.

397
23:42.248 --> 23:43.740
When masters don't act like masters,

398
23:43.750 --> 23:45.096
servants won't act like servants,

399
23:45.352 --> 23:47.000
and the household will never know peace.

400
23:48.440 --> 23:49.200
Yuchan.

401
23:51.920 --> 23:52.680
Yuchan!

402
23:54.640 --> 23:55.350
Yuchan!

403
23:57.920 --> 23:58.720
Listen to me.

404
23:59.224 --> 24:00.310
I don't want to hear it.

405
24:06.160 --> 24:07.200
If you keep this up,

406
24:07.270 --> 24:08.240
I'll call for someone.

407
24:09.110 --> 24:09.880
Go ahead.

408
24:10.000 --> 24:12.392
Might as well bring out the Young Master and Young Madam too.

409
24:12.400 --> 24:13.550
We can settle this

410
24:13.640 --> 24:14.590
right in front of them.

411
24:18.008 --> 24:19.440
What exactly are you trying to say?

412
24:19.510 --> 24:19.880
I...

413
24:21.000 --> 24:22.160
I asked you something earlier,

414
24:22.184 --> 24:23.450
and you still haven't answered.

415
24:24.680 --> 24:25.270
Do you...

416
24:25.960 --> 24:27.640
Do you know how I feel about you or not?

417
24:29.920 --> 24:31.030
Out of nowhere...

418
24:31.200 --> 24:32.720
What's gotten into you?

419
24:35.544 --> 24:37.352
Do you know

420
24:37.420 --> 24:38.590
how many dead bodies I've seen

421
24:38.590 --> 24:40.160
since the day before yesterday until today?

422
24:40.968 --> 24:42.590
I kept thinking about you the whole time.

423
24:44.030 --> 24:45.000
Didn't you think about me

424
24:46.480 --> 24:47.550
even a little?

425
24:51.000 --> 24:52.240
Swords don't pick their targets.

426
24:53.880 --> 24:55.160
What if I had died...

427
24:55.240 --> 24:55.790
Stop it!

428
24:56.310 --> 24:57.160
There's no "what if".

429
24:59.880 --> 25:00.790
Quick, take that back!

430
25:01.790 --> 25:02.750
A troublemaker like you

431
25:03.310 --> 25:04.590
is bound to live to a hundred.

432
25:06.750 --> 25:08.200
So you do care about me.

433
25:11.720 --> 25:12.960
I'm older than you,

434
25:13.960 --> 25:15.240
and I've been married before.

435
25:16.550 --> 25:18.000
Madam Wu would never agree.

436
25:21.688 --> 25:23.160
I never dared to let myself care.

437
25:27.448 --> 25:29.704
You'd better give up on this too. The sooner, the better.

438
25:34.030 --> 25:34.750
As for my mother,

439
25:36.030 --> 25:37.030
I'll find a way.

440
25:39.080 --> 25:40.400
What way could you possibly find?

441
25:41.480 --> 25:42.590
Your father died young.

442
25:42.872 --> 25:45.070
Madam Wu raised you on her own. It wasn't easy for her.

443
25:46.000 --> 25:47.350
You mustn't break her heart.

444
25:48.960 --> 25:49.720
Besides...

445
25:50.160 --> 25:50.960
Besides,

446
25:51.736 --> 25:53.680
you were sold into the household at six or seven,

447
25:54.200 --> 25:55.960
and you don't remember who your parents are

448
25:55.976 --> 25:56.936
or where you came from.

449
25:58.160 --> 25:59.270
My mother took pity on you

450
25:59.304 --> 26:00.550
and has always looked after you.

451
26:01.960 --> 26:03.590
So you can't do anything to hurt her.

452
26:05.640 --> 26:06.070
You...

453
26:12.720 --> 26:13.400
You...

454
26:15.448 --> 26:16.968
When you were hiding in the theater...

455
26:23.110 --> 26:24.310
You were worried about me too.

456
26:26.480 --> 26:27.270
You were scared

457
26:29.030 --> 26:30.030
you'd never see me again.

458
26:33.240 --> 26:33.830
Weren't you?

459
26:53.270 --> 26:55.230
♪A faint trace of fragrance♪

460
26:56.270 --> 26:57.200
Trust me.

461
26:57.350 --> 26:58.440
I'll get my mother

462
26:58.480 --> 27:00.440
to gladly agree to our marriage!

463
27:01.750 --> 27:04.160
Jiugao is usually so sharp.

464
27:04.440 --> 27:05.750
Nothing ever gets past him.

465
27:06.790 --> 27:08.480
Yet here we are,

466
27:08.640 --> 27:09.640
standing right here,

467
27:09.960 --> 27:11.640
and he didn't notice a thing.

468
27:12.000 --> 27:13.790
Whenever Jiugao was around Yuchan,

469
27:14.270 --> 27:15.550
I'd get anxious for him.

470
27:15.830 --> 27:16.720
But today,

471
27:17.110 --> 27:18.750
it's like he's finally figured it out.

472
27:20.550 --> 27:22.160
The old saying is true.

473
27:22.400 --> 27:25.480
Every setback makes you a little wiser.

474
27:25.480 --> 27:27.310
♪I can't forget♪

475
27:27.920 --> 27:29.070
Mending what's broken

476
27:29.750 --> 27:31.030
is never too late.

477
27:33.200 --> 27:36.080
♪Love lingers all around us♪

478
27:37.120 --> 27:41.992
♪Holding hands through this life, breathing♪

479
27:42.000 --> 27:47.420
♪In the fragrance that fills the courtyard♪

480
27:57.960 --> 27:58.750
You're back.

481
28:04.310 --> 28:05.790
I thought you'd gone to sleep.

482
28:06.480 --> 28:07.680
I was waiting for you.

483
28:09.310 --> 28:10.310
Where did you go?

484
28:12.070 --> 28:13.750
I had some things to think over,

485
28:14.240 --> 28:16.720
so I sat outside and let the breeze clear my head for a while.

486
28:17.160 --> 28:18.160
Before I knew it,

487
28:18.590 --> 28:19.550
night had fallen.

488
28:32.880 --> 28:34.110
Two heads are better

489
28:34.830 --> 28:36.000
than one.

490
28:37.160 --> 28:39.000
Would you share it with your husband?

491
28:49.590 --> 28:50.480
In plays,

492
28:51.310 --> 28:52.310
officials who hold a post

493
28:52.310 --> 28:53.750
but neglect its duties

494
28:54.030 --> 28:55.440
are the ones people hate most.

495
28:56.480 --> 28:58.030
And without realizing it,

496
28:58.750 --> 29:01.070
I've become one of those petty villains on the stage.

497
29:02.790 --> 29:04.200
What makes you say that?

498
29:05.544 --> 29:07.270
I'm the Young Madam of the Lin Residence.

499
29:08.000 --> 29:09.640
What the servants and maids

500
29:10.110 --> 29:11.030
should do

501
29:11.310 --> 29:12.350
and shouldn't do,

502
29:12.400 --> 29:14.070
who to employ and who not to,

503
29:14.790 --> 29:16.480
all of it should be under my charge.

504
29:18.270 --> 29:20.350
But I held the position without doing the job.

505
29:21.784 --> 29:22.830
As a result, the servants

506
29:23.550 --> 29:24.830
became a mixed lot,

507
29:25.350 --> 29:26.720
with no loyalty among them.

508
29:29.640 --> 29:31.480
Luckily, the Second Young Master was here,

509
29:32.160 --> 29:33.960
so we only lost some valuables.

510
29:35.350 --> 29:36.720
But the driver at the retreat

511
29:37.030 --> 29:38.550
not only stole money,

512
29:38.920 --> 29:41.030
but he also abandoned Xiaolian in the wilderness.

513
29:42.590 --> 29:43.750
If not for Nanke,

514
29:45.310 --> 29:47.720
Xiaolian would have frozen to death outside the capital.

515
29:53.400 --> 29:55.720
I thought if I stayed out of it

516
29:55.992 --> 29:57.750
and kept to myself, that would be enough.

517
30:00.590 --> 30:01.880
But I forgot

518
30:02.830 --> 30:04.160
that when you're part of it all,

519
30:05.070 --> 30:06.200
you can't stay untouched.

520
30:08.200 --> 30:10.070
I nearly cost someone her life.

521
30:11.208 --> 30:12.920
That would have been a grave mistake.

522
30:15.640 --> 30:16.830
It's not your fault.

523
30:18.680 --> 30:19.480
It's mine.

524
30:20.720 --> 30:22.510
I ignored your wishes

525
30:23.070 --> 30:24.070
and married you.

526
30:25.590 --> 30:27.350
That's why you resented me,

527
30:28.880 --> 30:30.960
paid no attention to the household affairs,

528
30:32.680 --> 30:34.550
and always treated yourself as an outsider.

529
30:42.550 --> 30:43.350
Lanxiang,

530
30:44.920 --> 30:45.790
before,

531
30:47.110 --> 30:49.400
I always thought it was because of Han Liang

532
30:50.680 --> 30:52.160
that you resented me

533
30:52.792 --> 30:55.720
and refused to settle into being the Young Madam of the Lin family.

534
30:57.830 --> 30:59.830
But only now do I understand

535
31:01.720 --> 31:03.270
it was never about love for another man.

536
31:04.830 --> 31:05.640
Rather,

537
31:09.440 --> 31:11.270
it's just like when Grand Secretary Zhao

538
31:12.070 --> 31:14.200
wanted to control my career and my life,

539
31:15.680 --> 31:17.960
to make me serve him and the Zhao family.

540
31:19.920 --> 31:21.720
I chose to give up the brush for the sword

541
31:22.310 --> 31:24.000
and joined the army in Jinzhou

542
31:25.880 --> 31:27.510
rather than let him control me.

543
31:30.920 --> 31:32.200
I suppose it's the same for you.

544
31:34.270 --> 31:35.350
What you resent

545
31:36.550 --> 31:38.510
is that I took away your freedom.

546
31:40.350 --> 31:41.440
I thought

547
31:42.110 --> 31:44.310
if I said sweet things to please you,

548
31:45.680 --> 31:46.960
if I were gentler,

549
31:47.510 --> 31:48.830
more considerate,

550
31:49.720 --> 31:51.000
and treated you better,

551
31:52.920 --> 31:54.350
I could win your heart.

552
31:55.790 --> 31:58.200
But only after I read The Tale of the Feathered Immortal

553
31:59.590 --> 32:00.590
did I realize

554
32:02.880 --> 32:04.160
that in your eyes,

555
32:05.030 --> 32:06.310
love between a man and a woman

556
32:07.510 --> 32:09.640
is nothing but flowers on a desolate grave,

557
32:11.000 --> 32:12.550
a fair face over bare bones,

558
32:13.960 --> 32:15.480
like a dream, like a bubble,

559
32:16.960 --> 32:18.440
gone in an instant.

560
32:20.350 --> 32:21.920
I was too arrogant.

561
32:23.680 --> 32:24.640
I underestimated you.

562
32:33.480 --> 32:34.240
Actually,

563
32:36.440 --> 32:37.790
I underestimated you, too.

564
32:39.960 --> 32:42.270
True, you don't know what I think,

565
32:42.750 --> 32:44.000
or what I like and dislike.

566
32:45.960 --> 32:48.310
But I don't know what you think,

567
32:49.368 --> 32:51.000
or what you like and dislike, either.

568
33:05.160 --> 33:06.680
We're both still young.

569
33:11.160 --> 33:12.720
We have plenty of time

570
33:14.640 --> 33:16.400
to truly get to know each other.

571
33:30.830 --> 33:32.000
Between you and me,

572
33:33.110 --> 33:34.830
there are too many barriers.

573
33:36.510 --> 33:37.680
You and I

574
33:39.384 --> 33:40.350
walk different paths.

575
33:42.270 --> 33:44.160
Do you mean family background and status?

576
33:47.750 --> 33:48.960
I promise you,

577
33:50.030 --> 33:51.160
from now on,

578
33:52.070 --> 33:53.030
I will respect you

579
33:53.640 --> 33:54.400
and value you

580
33:55.400 --> 33:57.240
as if you were another me in this world.

581
33:58.350 --> 33:59.960
Even if right now

582
34:01.240 --> 34:03.160
you don't love me as a wife loves her husband,

583
34:07.680 --> 34:09.590
we've been through hardship together.

584
34:11.096 --> 34:12.960
We already share a bond as husband and wife.

585
34:16.030 --> 34:17.360
No matter what,

586
34:18.440 --> 34:19.230
we both

587
34:21.280 --> 34:22.800
have to live well.

588
34:32.510 --> 34:34.230
There's a lot to do tomorrow.

589
34:35.920 --> 34:37.670
You should get some rest, too.

590
34:43.700 --> 34:48.190
♪Even if these trials consume my whole life♪

591
34:48.820 --> 34:52.990
♪I'll only return to the moment our fate began♪

592
34:53.420 --> 34:56.720
♪I've searched and searched, wandering in circles♪

593
34:56.720 --> 34:59.510
♪Yet I can never mend that old dream♪

594
34:59.830 --> 35:02.660
♪Leaving only regret behind♪

595
35:02.860 --> 35:07.290
♪Thankfully, these trials have spared me a lifetime♪

596
35:07.700 --> 35:12.800
♪In this life and the next, it will always be you♪

597
35:13.400 --> 35:21.530
♪I only pray that fate lets us meet sooner♪

598
35:23.980 --> 35:28.020
(Mahavira Hall)

599
35:28.020 --> 35:32.100
(Devotee Mu, Devotee Chen)

600
35:35.980 --> 35:39.580
(Devotee Qingxiang)

601
35:39.580 --> 35:43.140
(Devotee Xingtang)

602
36:18.150 --> 36:19.030
This tree

603
36:19.760 --> 36:21.480
looks the same year after year,

604
36:22.510 --> 36:24.590
but people change with every passing year.

605
36:26.030 --> 36:27.110
Who would have thought

606
36:27.920 --> 36:29.480
someone like Zhao Xingtang

607
36:29.800 --> 36:31.320
could be gone just like that?

608
36:43.190 --> 36:44.400
Life is unpredictable,

609
36:44.760 --> 36:46.070
and people's hearts are fickle.

610
36:47.360 --> 36:49.800
When I insisted on separating from the Lu family,

611
36:51.440 --> 36:53.440
everyone condemned me for defying propriety.

612
36:54.000 --> 36:55.400
Now they all praise me

613
36:55.400 --> 36:56.630
for my foresight.

614
36:57.760 --> 36:59.550
I not only saved myself,

615
37:00.960 --> 37:02.510
but my daughter's life as well.

616
37:04.670 --> 37:05.670
What about Jun?

617
37:06.670 --> 37:08.150
Has Jinqi given you a definite answer?

618
37:08.920 --> 37:09.920
Jinqi said

619
37:10.360 --> 37:13.070
since Jun is still so young,

620
37:13.112 --> 37:14.550
His Majesty is willing to spare him.

621
37:18.110 --> 37:18.960
It's just that...

622
37:21.896 --> 37:24.490
For three generations, they can't take the imperial examinations

623
37:25.590 --> 37:26.630
or hold office.

624
37:28.320 --> 37:29.710
For a man,

625
37:29.944 --> 37:31.510
the examinations and officialdom aren't

626
37:31.510 --> 37:32.550
the only path in life.

627
37:33.280 --> 37:34.710
Lanxiang said the same thing before.

628
37:40.440 --> 37:42.590
First Young Lady, Second Young Lady.

629
37:42.800 --> 37:44.320
The Young Madam is still at prayer?

630
37:45.016 --> 37:46.760
Second Butler Yang has something to report?

631
37:46.840 --> 37:48.216
The Young Madam instructed earlier

632
37:48.220 --> 37:50.320
that Sixth Young Lady Zhao's body at the public burial ground

633
37:50.440 --> 37:52.460
be placed in a coffin and sent to the Xie family.

634
37:52.510 --> 37:53.990
But while we were preparing her body,

635
37:54.030 --> 37:55.400
we learned that the Sixth Young Lady

636
37:55.410 --> 37:57.870
had separated from her husband and returned to her parents' home.

637
37:57.880 --> 38:00.190
Now the entire Zhao family is in prison.

638
38:00.440 --> 38:02.320
What should be done with the body?

639
38:02.670 --> 38:04.510
We need the Young Madam to decide.

640
38:04.792 --> 38:06.670
This is Zhao Xingluo's separation agreement?

641
38:07.480 --> 38:08.280
Yes.

642
38:09.070 --> 38:09.880
Let me see.

643
38:09.920 --> 38:10.360
Here.

644
38:12.968 --> 38:13.980
(Separation Agreement)

645
38:14.000 --> 38:15.848
(Our bond was formed across three lifetimes,)

646
38:15.960 --> 38:17.710
(we were wed through the six rites,)

647
38:18.456 --> 38:20.280
(and became husband and wife in this life.)

648
38:20.728 --> 38:22.440
(But since our hearts have grown apart,)

649
38:22.510 --> 38:23.670
(we can no longer be as one.)

650
38:24.550 --> 38:26.880
(May my wife, after we part,)

651
38:27.320 --> 38:29.840
(let go of all resentment and smile again,)

652
38:30.230 --> 38:31.840
(find a husband of high rank,)

653
38:32.280 --> 38:33.550
(enjoy feasts and merry games,)

654
38:33.560 --> 38:35.432
(and live in harmony, like strings in perfect tune.)

655
38:35.710 --> 38:38.000
Grand Secretary Zhao had a good eye for grandsons-in-law.

656
38:38.760 --> 38:41.000
Zhao Xingluo's husband

657
38:41.760 --> 38:42.630
had fine handwriting,

658
38:42.800 --> 38:43.630
fine writing,

659
38:44.030 --> 38:45.440
and an especially fine heart.

660
38:47.320 --> 38:48.230
Sadly,

661
38:48.510 --> 38:50.440
just like Zhao Xingtang,

662
38:51.030 --> 38:52.400
Zhao Xingluo had poor judgment.

663
38:53.540 --> 38:55.780
(Drawn up by Xie Zhao)

664
38:59.480 --> 39:01.840
The Xie family has already arranged a match for Xie Zhao.

665
39:02.280 --> 39:04.550
It's the sixth daughter of the Zhao family's third branch.

666
39:07.360 --> 39:08.150
What is it?

667
39:09.760 --> 39:10.550
Nothing.

668
39:20.550 --> 39:21.400
Young Madam.

669
39:22.150 --> 39:22.920
Young Madam.

670
39:23.280 --> 39:24.840
This separation agreement was found

671
39:24.840 --> 39:26.110
on the Sixth Young Lady's body.

672
39:26.480 --> 39:29.800
How should we handle her remains?

673
39:34.110 --> 39:35.480
She deserves to be laid to rest.

674
39:36.760 --> 39:37.590
I'll pay

675
39:37.800 --> 39:39.190
for Zhao Xingluo's burial,

676
39:39.760 --> 39:40.960
and ask the monks at the temple

677
39:40.960 --> 39:42.280
to perform a ritual for her.

678
39:42.710 --> 39:43.440
Yes.

679
39:48.792 --> 39:50.320
You're so kind-hearted, Young Madam.

680
39:50.920 --> 39:52.590
Zhao Xingluo used to

681
39:52.590 --> 39:53.840
mock you

682
39:54.110 --> 39:55.510
and made snide remarks all the time.

683
39:56.408 --> 39:57.630
In the face of life and death,

684
39:58.000 --> 39:59.550
those are trivial matters.

685
40:06.510 --> 40:07.960
Will you come home with me,

686
40:08.190 --> 40:09.280
or look around a bit more?

687
40:13.280 --> 40:14.480
We'll go with you, Lanxiang.

688
40:15.960 --> 40:16.630
Good.

689
40:16.680 --> 40:18.320
I have something to discuss with you.

690
40:22.190 --> 40:23.280
So formal?

691
40:23.760 --> 40:25.630
What is it you'd like to discuss, Lanxiang?

692
40:28.280 --> 40:29.440
Since we came to the capital,

693
40:29.544 --> 40:31.510
the household has taken on many more servants.

694
40:31.928 --> 40:33.360
Before, when Aunt Lingxiao was here,

695
40:33.360 --> 40:34.710
she took care of everything.

696
40:35.670 --> 40:37.110
But since she went back to Jinling,

697
40:37.360 --> 40:39.630
there's been no one in charge.

698
40:40.550 --> 40:41.760
Yang Fu is capable,

699
40:41.944 --> 40:43.710
but he's not one of the masters after all.

700
40:44.670 --> 40:45.550
He told me

701
40:45.688 --> 40:46.840
that these past few days,

702
40:47.150 --> 40:49.070
whenever he couldn't decide something,

703
40:49.320 --> 40:50.800
he'd come to you, Xiulai.

704
40:53.280 --> 40:54.590
I could see your mind

705
40:54.590 --> 40:56.230
wasn't on household chores.

706
40:57.070 --> 40:57.960
And I figured

707
40:58.190 --> 41:00.030
I'm just another mouth to feed here anyway,

708
41:00.550 --> 41:01.960
and I had time on my hands.

709
41:02.880 --> 41:04.000
So when Yang Fu came to me,

710
41:05.000 --> 41:06.110
I made a few decisions.

711
41:06.590 --> 41:07.920
If I did anything wrong,

712
41:07.920 --> 41:09.416
please don't hesitate to punish me.

713
41:10.670 --> 41:11.510
Sit down, Xiulai.

714
41:16.280 --> 41:18.030
You handled everything

715
41:18.280 --> 41:19.550
remarkably well.

716
41:20.190 --> 41:21.150
To name just one thing,

717
41:21.368 --> 41:22.480
before the Chinese New Year,

718
41:22.490 --> 41:24.390
the gifts you prepared for the other households

719
41:24.408 --> 41:25.630
were perfectly appropriate.

720
41:25.920 --> 41:28.110
You thought through every social nicety.

721
41:29.360 --> 41:30.480
Xiulai is skilled

722
41:30.590 --> 41:33.030
at needlework, cooking, calligraphy,

723
41:33.110 --> 41:34.110
and bookkeeping.

724
41:35.190 --> 41:37.800
Too bad the Lu family was too blind to see her worth.

725
41:45.880 --> 41:48.150
I'm not as capable as Xiuwan makes me sound.

726
41:53.710 --> 41:54.670
This rebellion

727
41:55.280 --> 41:56.710
taught me a lesson, too.

728
41:57.400 --> 41:58.630
Let me tell you both something

729
41:58.630 --> 41:59.880
from the bottom of my heart.

730
42:00.960 --> 42:02.400
Your brother

731
42:02.410 --> 42:04.210
pushed me into this role before I was ready.

732
42:04.920 --> 42:06.280
My heart truly isn't in

733
42:06.400 --> 42:09.360
managing the food, clothing, and lodging of an entire household,

734
42:09.590 --> 42:11.150
down to every last daily need.

735
42:11.880 --> 42:13.110
Nor do I care to figure out,

736
42:13.110 --> 42:15.510
when Master Cheng's third concubine suffers a miscarriage,

737
42:15.670 --> 42:17.400
how to send condolence gifts

738
42:17.710 --> 42:19.280
that express sympathy

739
42:19.550 --> 42:21.030
without offending the in-laws.

740
42:22.184 --> 42:23.960
Marriage really has nothing good about it.

741
42:24.550 --> 42:25.760
Lanxiang is right.

742
42:25.840 --> 42:27.304
There you go, talking nonsense again.

743
42:27.800 --> 42:28.920
Men handle affairs outside,

744
42:29.192 --> 42:30.230
and women manage the home.

745
42:31.320 --> 42:33.030
If women don't take care of their families,

746
42:33.150 --> 42:34.710
should they go be officials instead?

747
42:35.944 --> 42:37.320
Everyone has their own aspirations.

748
42:37.600 --> 42:40.380
Ever since we were little, you've always been the proper eldest sister,

749
42:40.400 --> 42:42.152
always fussing over and caring for others.

750
42:42.710 --> 42:43.670
I'm not like that.

751
42:46.400 --> 42:47.760
The Lin Residence is so large,

752
42:48.320 --> 42:49.280
and with the retreat,

753
42:49.512 --> 42:51.128
there are over a hundred people.

754
42:51.416 --> 42:53.630
We can't go without someone running the household.

755
42:59.150 --> 43:00.480
What you mean is...

756
43:05.020 --> 43:07.940
=Against the Current= (Next Episode's Preview)

757
43:09.400 --> 43:10.070
Good.

758
43:10.590 --> 43:12.550
This is truly wonderful news.

759
43:15.320 --> 43:16.000
Wonderful.

760
43:24.952 --> 43:25.320
Old...

761
43:25.480 --> 43:26.110
Old Madam!

762
43:28.230 --> 43:28.880
Old Madam!

763
43:31.590 --> 43:32.840
- Mother! - What do we do?

764
43:32.850 --> 43:33.440
What do we do?

765
43:33.440 --> 43:34.480
- Mother! - Mother!

766
43:34.480 --> 43:35.070
What's wrong?

767
43:35.150 --> 43:36.400
Mother! Mother, what's wrong?

768
43:36.400 --> 43:37.840
Stop! Don't move her!

769
43:37.840 --> 43:39.360
Stand aside. Don't get in the way!

770
43:39.550 --> 43:40.360
Mother!

771
43:41.320 --> 43:42.960
Huaixiang, fetch a basin of hot water.

772
43:43.280 --> 43:45.920
Mother! Mother, are you all right?

773
43:46.550 --> 43:48.070
Madam Wu, get the medicine box.

774
43:48.104 --> 43:49.590
Huaixiang, fetch a basin of hot water.

775
43:49.590 --> 43:50.710
Quick! Hurry!

776
43:52.350 --> 43:52.930
Mother!

777
44:08.340 --> 44:12.460
♪Spring slips from the branches once more♪

778
44:15.300 --> 44:19.820
♪Flowers bloom unseen, as they have before♪

779
44:21.100 --> 44:25.020
♪All the joys and sorrows come and go♪

780
44:25.700 --> 44:28.460
♪While loss leaves winter in the heart♪

781
44:29.180 --> 44:31.500
♪Though all the world may fade♪

782
44:31.500 --> 44:34.580
♪Time rolls on as countless lives rush by♪

783
44:36.100 --> 44:40.340
♪Night winds wander through the halls of long ago♪

784
44:43.260 --> 44:47.420
♪No page could hold the longing words can never show♪

785
44:49.220 --> 44:52.780
♪Every joy and sorrow in this fleeting life♪

786
44:52.780 --> 44:56.340
♪Fades into the past as new wounds rise♪

787
44:57.140 --> 45:02.820
♪While whispers of perfume linger beneath the eaves♪

788
45:03.180 --> 45:07.500
♪Let the cold wind rage, let the wild rain fall♪

789
45:07.860 --> 45:10.820
♪Let sorrow spill like shadows over all♪

790
45:10.820 --> 45:14.580
♪Let love fall to pieces, let old anger burn away♪

791
45:14.580 --> 45:17.460
♪Let the past die with yesterday♪

792
45:17.460 --> 45:21.540
♪One last fire, one last cup of wine♪

793
45:21.540 --> 45:24.900
♪And silver moonlight to guide me through the night♪

794
45:24.900 --> 45:28.660
♪Let beginnings fade as endings come to call♪

795
45:28.660 --> 45:32.660
♪From this endless dream, there's no return at all♪

796
45:33.420 --> 45:37.580
♪Let the cold wind rage, let the wild rain fall♪

797
45:37.580 --> 45:41.020
♪Let sorrow spill like shadows over all♪

798
